  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 150eb (Premium)<br><strong>Type:</strong> Shield Attachment<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p>Needs a DV17 Basic Tech check to install and can't be removed; not for Popup Shields. Adds 2 mounts for: a Cyberscanner, Flashlight, handheld audio/video gear (Video Camera, Cybercam EX-1, Audio Recorder, Radio Scanner/Music Player, Radio Communicator, MiniMag Speakers, Pocket Amplifier), Radar Detector, small storage (Chipvault, Tech Bag, Medtech Bag; not Carryalls), or an Umbrella. Items are bought separately; mounting one is free and takes 10 minutes. They only work while the shield is wielded with HP left, and are destroyed with it if it's Destroyed Beyond Repair.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Shield Attachments and Enhancements follow the Armor Attachment and Enhancement rules, but for Bulletproof Shields, including cyberware ones; not for vehicle Bulletproof Glass. Corgo's optional rule: a Bulletproof Shield with HP left puts its wielder in Cover and counts as a 2x2m/yds piece of Cover against Suppressive Fire, which they may share with one adjacent character.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Shields).</em></p>"
  },
